 // ---- 稀疏贴图：本项目不支持 sparse tiling（Builder 的 sparse 布局一律按普通纹理建），查询时把输出结构清零并点名一次，
 //      不返回「看起来像成功」的假布局 ----
+// RewindBox (patch 0012): the texture's own layout, the same answer as nvnTextureBuilderGetSparseTileLayout on the builder it
+//   was made from (nvn_tex_sparse_layout on the description TextureInitialize copied). nvn_tex.c already lays sparse textures
+//   out by those 64 KiB pages (sparse_levels, level_walk), and MapVirtual maps tiles into virtual pools. Mario Kart World
+//   (0400C3F00006E000, IPA 732) asks the texture, not the builder: with the empty layout it sent 0-byte tile mappings, MapVirtual
+//   failed 9 times and the game crashed on a null pointer (address 0x4) 30 s after nnMain. A texture that is not sparse still
+//   gets all zeros, as before; so does an object that was never initialized.
 NVN(nvnTextureGetSparseTileLayout, void, const NVNtexture *t, NVNtextureSparseTileLayout *layout) {
-    (void)t; if (layout) memset(layout, 0, sizeof *layout);
-    static int once; if (!once++) LOG("【红】 nvnTextureGetSparseTileLayout: sparse tiled textures are not supported, the layout is reported empty");
+    uint32_t tile[4] = {0, 0, 0, 0};
+    if (t) nvn_tex_sparse_layout(&CTX(t)->d, tile);
+    if (layout) memcpy(layout, tile, sizeof tile);
+    static _Atomic int logged; if (tile[0] && !atomic_exchange(&logged, 1))
+        LOG("RewindBox: nvnTextureGetSparseTileLayout: %u tiled levels, tile %ux%ux%u (the texture's own layout; later queries are not logged)", tile[0], tile[1], tile[2], tile[3]);
 }
